c("Q7.1",AM,"INFERENCE","INFERRED",AU,S,"The South's rise is larger than sampling error, but our data can't show that it was caused by the new store openings, so we can't put a number of points on them.","M2 (avg change +4.08 ±1.32; Aug-Aug +7.7 vs 4.60); methodology_summary (intent survey); no attribution source","Rejects the question's causal premise; no authorized source supports any attribution.")
